<title>FRANCE: Price of Thomson one franc - Arthuis.</title>
<headline>Price of Thomson one franc - Arthuis.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sale of state electronics group Thomson to Lagardere will be priced at &quot;one symbolic franc,&quot; French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He was speaking at a news conference after the government said it preferred Lagardere's bid to buy the company over a rival offer by Alcatel Alsthom.</p>
<p>The government said it would make a final decision between the two after a report from the privatisation commission.</p>
</text>
